# Algothon 25 — Backtesting Framework

A research-grade backtesting framework for the Algothon trading competition. Evaluates any `getMyPosition()` strategy against the 50-instrument simulated universe with accounting identical to the official `eval.py`, then extends it with configurable windows, walk-forward cross-validation, bootstrap confidence intervals, parameter sweeps, and a full suite of risk and trade diagnostics.

