## Metrics reference

### Competition score
| Key | Description |
|---|---|
| `score` | `mean(PL) - 0.1 * std(PL)` — the competition objective |
| `mean_pl` | Mean daily PL ($) |
| `std_pl` | Std dev of daily PL (population, ddof=0 — matches eval.py score) |
| `std_pl_sample` | Sample std (ddof=1 — used for inferential stats) |
| `ann_sharpe` | Annualised Sharpe: `sqrt(250) * mean / std` |
| `t_stat` | t-statistic for H0: mean daily PL = 0 |
| `p_value` | Two-sided p-value (i.i.d. assumption — **optimistic**, see Methodology) |
| `pl_per_dollar_traded` | eval.py's "ret": cumulative PL ÷ dollar volume. **Not** a return on capital |
| `total_dvolume` | Total gross dollar volume traded |
| `total_commission` | Total commission paid ($) |
| `commission_pct_of_dvolume` | Total commission as a fraction of gross dollar volume |
| `n_eval_days` | Number of days in the eval window |
| `best_day_pl` / `worst_day_pl` | Single best / worst daily PL ($) |

### Risk-adjusted returns
| Key | Description |
|---|---|
| `sortino` | Annualised Sortino ratio (target downside deviation, MAR=0, full-N denominator) |
| `calmar_ratio` | Annualised dollar PL / max drawdown |
| `omega_ratio` | Gross gains / gross losses (>1 = net positive) |
| `var_95` / `cvar_95` | Historical VaR / CVaR at 95% confidence |
| `var_99` / `cvar_99` | Historical VaR / CVaR at 99% confidence |
| `downside_dev` | Target downside deviation (RMS of `min(PL, 0)` over all days) |

### Drawdown analysis
| Key | Description |
|---|---|
| `max_drawdown` | Peak-to-trough drawdown on cumulative portfolio value ($) |
| `max_pl_drawdown` | Peak-to-trough drawdown on the cumulative PL series ($ — equals `max_drawdown` here; kept for clarity) |
| `max_drawdown_pct_capital` | Max drawdown as a fraction of average gross exposure (capital deployed) |
| `capital_base` | Average gross dollar exposure (the % denominator) |
| `max_drawdown_duration_days` | Longest single drawdown period (days) |
| `avg_drawdown_duration_days` | Mean length of drawdown periods |
| `pct_time_underwater` | Fraction of eval days below equity peak |
| `ulcer_index` | RMS of percentage drawdown (penalises depth and duration) |
| `pain_ratio` | Sharpe scaled by Ulcer index |

### Distribution & tail risk
| Key | Description |
|---|---|
| `skewness` | PL distribution skewness (negative = left-tail heavy) |
| `kurtosis_excess` | Excess kurtosis vs. normal (>0 = fat tails) |
| `tail_ratio` | P95 / \|P5\| (>1 = right-skewed tails) |
| `avg_win` / `avg_loss` | Average winning / losing day PL |
| `profit_factor` | Gross wins / gross losses (>1 = profitable) |
| `win_loss_ratio` | avg_win / \|avg_loss\| |
| `max_consec_loss_days` | Longest losing streak |
| `max_consec_win_days` | Longest winning streak |

### PL dynamics
| Key | Description |
|---|---|
| `autocorr_lag1` | Lag-1 autocorrelation of daily PL (+= trending, –= mean-reverting) |
| `rolling_sharpe_20d` | Array: rolling 20-day annualised Sharpe (for plots) |

